      "incumbent": false,
      "summary": "Alex Bores is a New York State Assemblymember for the 73rd District, first elected in 2022, representing parts of Manhattan's East Side. A computer scientist by training who worked at Palantir Technologies, he has focused on artificial intelligence regulation and technology policy, co-sponsoring the RAISE Act on AI safety. He is running for Congress on a platform of affordability, ethics in technology, and countering what he describes as the influence of tech executives on democracy.",
